WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Against a black background, a capsule-like camera separates into aligned components. Transparent outer pieces, a cylindrical body, a circuit-board-like component, rings, and end parts appear along the same axis. The viewpoint changes slightly while the assembly remains centered. This is an excerpt of the same concept animation used for the title’s actuator-and-camera view.
